Name;Notes;Unintentional;Intentional;Environmental;EN Name;EN Notes;SK Name;SK Notes
Pollution, dust,  corrosion, frost;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by contamination, dust, frost, or corrosion.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Pollution, dust,  corrosion, frost;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by contamination, dust, frost, or corrosion.;Znečistenie, prach, korózia, námraza;Poškodenie (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) znečistením, prachom, mrazom, koróziou.
Water, humidity;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by flooding or water leakage, typically due to plumbing failures.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Water, humidity;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by flooding or water leakage, typically due to plumbing failures.;Voda, vlhkosť;Poškodenie (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) záplavou, vytopením, typicky vodoinštalačnou haváriou.
Heat radiation;Data damage (typically on storage media) caused by heat radiation, infrared radiation, or extreme temperatures.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Heat radiation;Data damage (typically on storage media) caused by heat radiation, infrared radiation, or extreme temperatures.;Tepelné žiarenie;Poškodenie údajov (typicky na nosičoch) tepelným žiarením, infračerveným žiarením, neprimeranou teplotou.
Harmful radiation, radiation, or electromagnetic pulses;Damage or destruction of data (typically on storage media or IT equipment) caused by harmful electromagnetic radiation, radiation, or electromagnetic pulses.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Harmful radiation, radiation, or electromagnetic pulses;Damage or destruction of data (typically on storage media or IT equipment) caused by harmful electromagnetic radiation, radiation, or electromagnetic pulses.;Škodlivé žiarenie, radiácia alebo elektromagnetické impulzy;Poškodenie alebo zničenie údajov (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) škodlivým elektromagnetickým žiarením, radiáciou alebo elektromagnetickými impulzmi.
Interference of electrical signals;Interference from unshielded cables, possible induced voltages from power lines causing disruption of communication or functionality.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Interference of electrical signals;Interference from unshielded cables, possible induced voltages from power lines causing disruption of communication or functionality.;Interferencia elektrických signálov;Interferencia z netienených vedení, možné indukovanie napätí zo silových vodičov spôsobujúca narušenie komunikácie alebo funkčnosti.
Fire;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by fire.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Fire;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by fire.;Oheň;Poškodenie (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) požiarom.
Toxic substances in the area;The evaporation of toxic substances causing damage to electronic devices and posing a threat to human life or health.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Toxic substances in the area;The evaporation of toxic substances causing damage to electronic devices and posing a threat to human life or health.;Toxické látky v priestore;Vyparovanie toxických látok a poškodenie elektronických zariadení, ohrozenie ľudských životov alebo zdravia.
Surrounding events and accidents with negative impact;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) or functional limitations due to the influence of nearby events (e.g., radiation leak, fire in a neighboring building, chemical contamination, explosion nearby, traffic accident, aviation accident), including other consequences arising from the event – road closures, curfew, etc.;TRUE;FALSE;TRUE;Surrounding events and accidents with negative impact;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) or functional limitations due to the influence of nearby events (e.g., radiation leak, fire in a neighboring building, chemical contamination, explosion nearby, traffic accident, aviation accident), including other consequences arising from the event – road closures, curfew, etc.;Okolité udalosti a nehody s negatívnym vplyvom;Poškodenie (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) alebo obmedzenie funkcií z dôvodu vplyvu okolitých blízkych udalostí (napríklad únik radiácie, požiar vedľajšej budovy, chemické znečistenie, výbuch v blízkosti, dopravná nehoda, letecká nehoda) vrátane ďalších dôsledkov vyplývajúcich z udalosti - cestné uzávery, zákaz vychádzania a pod.
Terrorist attack, sabotage, explosion;Intentional manipulation or damage to physical objects, equipment, and/or processes, or functional limitations due to sabotage or a terrorist attack, with the aim of causing harm, or industrial accidents, explosions, etc.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Terrorist attack, sabotage, explosion;Intentional manipulation or damage to physical objects, equipment, and/or processes, or functional limitations due to sabotage or a terrorist attack, with the aim of causing harm, or industrial accidents, explosions, etc.;Teroristický útok, sabotáž, výbuch;Úmyselná manipulácia alebo poškodenie fyzických objektov, zariadení a/alebo procesov alebo obmedzenie funkcií z dôvodu sabotáže, alebo teroristického útoku, za účelom spôsobenia škody alebo priemyselná havária, výbuch a pod.
Coercion, extortion, corruption;Forcing a user(s) to perform unauthorized actions, disclose information, or modify data through violence, blackmail, corruption, or similar means.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Coercion, extortion, corruption;Forcing a user(s) to perform unauthorized actions, disclose information, or modify data through violence, blackmail, corruption, or similar means.;Prinútenie, vydieranie, korupcia ;Prinútenie používateľa(ov) k neautorizovanej činnosti alebo k prezradeniu, prípadne k modifikácií dát násilím, vydieraním, korupciou a pod.
Unauthorized entry into premises;Unauthorized and unapproved physical access to premises or protected areas.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized entry into premises;Unauthorized and unapproved physical access to premises or protected areas.;Neoprávnený vstup do priestorov;Neoprávnený a neautorizovaný fyzický vstup do priestorov alebo chránených priestorov.
Unauthorized use of devices and unauthorized access to devices;Unauthorized or non-approved access to systems or devices, compromising the security of equipment and services.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized use of devices and unauthorized access to devices;Unauthorized or non-approved access to systems or devices, compromising the security of equipment and services.;Neoprávnené používanie zariadení a neoprávnený prístup k zariadeniam;Neoprávnený alebo neautorizovaný prístup do systému alebo k zariadeniu, znižovanie zabezpečenia zariadení a služieb.
Physical theft or physical damage to devices or media;Physical theft of hardware, devices, mobile or portable equipment, installation files for software or software licenses, documents, etc., or intentional damage to devices or media, compromising the integrity of the device or medium.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Physical theft or physical damage to devices or media;Physical theft of hardware, devices, mobile or portable equipment, installation files for software or software licenses, documents, etc., or intentional damage to devices or media, compromising the integrity of the device or medium.;Fyzická krádež alebo fyzické poškodenie zariadení alebo médií;Fyzická krádež HW, zariadenia, mobilného a prenosného zariadenia,  inštalačného súboru SW alebo SW licencie, dokumentov a pod., alebo úmyselné poškodenie zariadení, alebo médií, narušenie integrity zariadenia alebo média.
Theft, infiltration, or modification of data during physical transfer;Breach of data confidentiality or integrity (intentional alteration) during physical transfer, such as on portable media (e.g., USB drives) or in paper form, transported by an employee or courier outside the organization's protected premises (e.g., transferring backups to a remote location). This may also include the theft of such data, leading to a loss of availability, among other issues.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Theft, infiltration, or modification of data during physical transfer;Breach of data confidentiality or integrity (intentional alteration) during physical transfer, such as on portable media (e.g., USB drives) or in paper form, transported by an employee or courier outside the organization's protected premises (e.g., transferring backups to a remote location). This may also include the theft of such data, leading to a loss of availability, among other issues.;Krádež, infiltrácia alebo modifikácia dát pri ich fyzickom prenose;Narušenie dôvernosti alebo integrity dát (ich úmyselné pozmenenie) pri ich fyzickom prenose, napr. na prenosnom médiu (USB) alebo v papierovej podobe, prenášaných zamestnancom alebo kuriérom mimo chránený priestor organizácie (napr. prenos záloh do vzdialenej lokality), prípadne krádež týchto dát a teda aj narušenie ich dostupnosti a pod.
Climatic or meteorological event;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) or functionality limitations due to a weather event – tornado, flood, landslide, avalanche, forest fire, or due to frost, high temperature, wind, humidity, or lightning.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Climatic or meteorological event;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) or functionality limitations due to a weather event – tornado, flood, landslide, avalanche, forest fire, or due to frost, high temperature, wind, humidity, or lightning.;Klimatický alebo meteorologický jav;Poškodenie (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) alebo obmedzenie funkcií z dôvodu klimatického javu - tornádo, záplava, povodeň, zosuv pôdy, lavína, lesný požiar alebo  mrazom, vysokou teplotou, vetrom, vlhkosťou, bleskom.
Seismic event;Damage (typically to premises, data carriers, or IT equipment) caused by an earthquake or other seismic events.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Seismic event;Damage (typically to premises, data carriers, or IT equipment) caused by an earthquake or other seismic events.;Seizmický jav;Poškodenie (typicky priestorov, nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) zemetrasením, alebo inými seizmickými udalosťami.
Volcanic event;Damage (typically to premises, data carriers, or IT equipment) caused by volcanic events.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Volcanic event;Damage (typically to premises, data carriers, or IT equipment) caused by volcanic events.;Sopečný fenomén;Poškodenie (typicky priestorov, nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení)  vulkanickými udalosťami.
Pandemic / epidemic event;A widespread epidemic or disease that spreads over a large geographic area and typically leads to staff unavailability.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Pandemic / epidemic event;A widespread epidemic or disease that spreads over a large geographic area and typically leads to staff unavailability.;Pandémia / epidemický jav;Rozsiahla epidémia, nemoc, ktorá sa rozširuje na geograficky rozsiahlom území a spôsobuje typicky nedostupnosť personálu.
Damage caused by animals;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by animals, such as rodents, and similar.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Damage caused by animals;Damage (typically to data carriers or IT equipment) caused by animals, such as rodents, and similar.;Poškodenie zvieraťom;Poškodenie (typicky nosičov údajov, alebo IT zariadení) zvieratami, napr. hlodavce a pod.
The existence of a known software vulnerability;The presence of a known vulnerability in software, especially when no security patch is available, or it is not possible to apply the security patch to the system, e.g., due to functionality disruption or similar reasons.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;The existence of a known software vulnerability;The presence of a known vulnerability in software, especially when no security patch is available, or it is not possible to apply the security patch to the system, e.g., due to functionality disruption or similar reasons.;Existencia známej zraniteľnosť v softvéri;Existencia známej zraniteľnosti v SW, najmä ak neexistuje bezpečnostná záplata, prípadne nie je možné na systém aplikovať bezpečnostnú záplatu, napr. z dôvodu narušenia funkčnosti a pod.
Unauthorized manipulation of software or a hacker attack;Any hacker attack or attempts to scan network addresses and ports, search for vulnerabilities, etc. Unauthorized manipulation of software, unauthorized or unapproved updates, configurations, component replacements, illegal data merging, unauthorized elevation of privileges, deleting traces of actions, abusing software functions, etc.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized manipulation of software or a hacker attack;Any hacker attack or attempts to scan network addresses and ports, search for vulnerabilities, etc. Unauthorized manipulation of software, unauthorized or unapproved updates, configurations, component replacements, illegal data merging, unauthorized elevation of privileges, deleting traces of actions, abusing software functions, etc.;Neautorizovaná manipulácia so SW alebo hackerský útok;Akýkoľvek hackerský útok alebo pokusy o skenovanie sieťových adries a portov, hľadanie zraniteľností a pod. Neoprávnená manipulácia so softvérom, nepovolené, neschválené  aktualizácie, konfigurácie, výmena komponentov, nelegálne spájanie údajov, nepovolené získanie vyšších oprávnení,  mazanie stôp po použití, zneužite softvérových funkcií, atď.
Malware infiltration;Infiltration by malicious code, such as a virus, worm, Trojan horse, logic bomb, rootkit, bootkit, backdoor methods, spyware, ransomware, adware, etc.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Malware infiltration;Infiltration by malicious code, such as a virus, worm, Trojan horse, logic bomb, rootkit, bootkit, backdoor methods, spyware, ransomware, adware, etc.;Infiltrácia malvérom;Infiltrácia škodlivým kódom, napr. vírus, červ, trójsky kôň, logická bomba, rootkit, bootkit, metóda tajných vstupov (backdoor), špionážny softvér (spyware), vydieračský softvér (ransomware), reklamný softvér (adware) atď.
Infiltration and modification of data – damage or loss of data;Change or destruction of data, alteration of values in a file, replacement of original values with falsified ones, modification of data without the author’s knowledge, sending multiple conflicting documents, manipulation or alteration of data that compromises its integrity, infiltration and modification of data in storage (DB, filesystem), etc.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Infiltration and modification of data – damage or loss of data;Change or destruction of data, alteration of values in a file, replacement of original values with falsified ones, modification of data without the author’s knowledge, sending multiple conflicting documents, manipulation or alteration of data that compromises its integrity, infiltration and modification of data in storage (DB, filesystem), etc.;Infiltrácia a modifikácia dát - poškodenie alebo strata údajov;Zmena, alebo zničenie údajov, zmena hodnôt v súbore,  nahradenie originálnych hodnôt falšovanými, zmeny údajov bez vedomia autora, odosielanie viacerých konfliktných dokumentov, manipulácia alebo zmena údajov, ktorá znamená narušenie ich integrity, infiltrácia a modifikácia dát v úložisku (DB, filesystém) a pod.
Communication interception;Unauthorized interception and monitoring of electronic communication and data flows, obtaining data sent via radiofrequency networks, data operation analysis or the type of threat during which the attacker penetrates the communication between two participants and without their knowledge begins to modify the communication (Man-in-the-Middle), Watching software keylogger and the like.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Communication interception;Unauthorized interception and monitoring of electronic communication and data flows, obtaining data sent via radiofrequency networks, data operation analysis or the type of threat during which the attacker penetrates the communication between two participants and without their knowledge begins to modify the communication (Man-in-the-Middle), Watching software keylogger and the like.;Infiltrácia komunikácie;Neautorizované odpočúvanie a sledovanie elektronickej komunikácie a dátových tokov, získavanie dát posielaných cez rádiofrekvenčné siete, analýza dátovej prevádzky alebo typ hrozby počas ktorej útočník prenikne do komunikácie medzi dvoma účastníkmi a bez ich vedomia začne komunikáciu neoprávnene modifikovať (man-in-the-middle), sledovanie softvérovým keyloggerom a pod.
Web communication infiltration;Damage or unauthorized change of content, typically of a website or application, which can change the information content, or even the visual appearance of the website or application (so-called defacement). The threat of penetrating the target system through web applications.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Web communication infiltration;Damage or unauthorized change of content, typically of a website or application, which can change the information content, or even the visual appearance of the website or application (so-called defacement). The threat of penetrating the target system through web applications.;Infiltrácia webovej komunikácie;Poškodenie, alebo neoprávnená zmena obsahu, typicky webovej stránky, alebo aplikácie, ktoré môže zmeniť informačný obsah, alebo aj vizuálny vzhľad webovej stránky, alebo aplikácie (tzv. defacement). Hrozba prieniku do cieľového systému prostredníctvom webových aplikácií.  
Unauthorized or misdirected messages;Unauthorized or incorrect activity related to e.g. With reorganization of transmission channels of electronic or materialized data, change of working language, changes in mail delivery, editing or redirection of messages, etc.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized or misdirected messages;Unauthorized or incorrect activity related to e.g. With reorganization of transmission channels of electronic or materialized data, change of working language, changes in mail delivery, editing or redirection of messages, etc.;Neautorizované alebo nesprávne smerovanie správ;Neautorizovaná alebo nesprávna činnosť súvisiaca napr. s reorganizáciou prenosových kanálov elektronických alebo materializovaných údajov, zmena pracovného jazyka, zmeny v doručovaní pošty, úprava alebo presmerovanie správ, atď.
Falsification of identity, rights or permissions and their misuse;Unauthorized alteration of identities and access rights into systems and their misuse for fraudulent action on behalf of another user.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Falsification of identity, rights or permissions and their misuse;Unauthorized alteration of identities and access rights into systems and their misuse for fraudulent action on behalf of another user.;Falšovanie identity, práv alebo povolení a ich zneužitie;Neoprávnené pozmeňovanie identít a prístupových práv do systémov, a ich zneužitie na podvodné konanie v mene iného používateľa.
Theft of digital identity;Unrolling identities, identity theft and access rights into systems.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Theft of digital identity;Unrolling identities, identity theft and access rights into systems.;Krádež digitálnej identity;Neoprávnené získanie identít, krádež identity a prístupových práv do systémov. 
Unauthorized location detection;Finding out data on geographical location (equipment, persons, data, etc.) that should remain secret.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized location detection;Finding out data on geographical location (equipment, persons, data, etc.) that should remain secret.;Neoprávnená detekcia polohy;Zistenie údajov o geografickej polohe (zariadenia, osoby, údajov a pod.), ktoré by mali zostať utajené.
Physical eavesdropping and surveillance, possibly through Electronic eavesdropping (EE) or similar methods (TEMPEST);Unoniators interception of spaces, monitoring of a foreign screen, taking a foreign screen, deployment of unauthorized GPS tracking devices, remote detection of the emitted electromagnetic signal (non -unwanted electromagnetic radiation), etc.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Physical eavesdropping and surveillance, possibly through Electronic eavesdropping (EE) or similar methods (TEMPEST);Unoniators interception of spaces, monitoring of a foreign screen, taking a foreign screen, deployment of unauthorized GPS tracking devices, remote detection of the emitted electromagnetic signal (non -unwanted electromagnetic radiation), etc.;Fyzické odpočúvanie a sledovanie, prípadne NEV;Neautorizované odpočúvanie priestorov, sledovanie cudzej obrazovky, odfotenie cudzej obrazovky,  nasadenie neautorizovaných GPS sledovacích zariadení, vzdialená detekcia vyžarovaného elektromagnetického signálu (NEV - nežiadúce elektromagnetické vyžarovanie) atď.
Retrieving data from improperly recycled or discarded media;Insufficient decommissioning and maintenance contracts, or inadequate or faulty decommissioning and maintenance procedures, can lead to unauthorized access to data and information.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Retrieving data from improperly recycled or discarded media;Insufficient decommissioning and maintenance contracts, or inadequate or faulty decommissioning and maintenance procedures, can lead to unauthorized access to data and information.;Získanie údajov zo zle recyklovaných alebo vyradených médií;Nedostatočné zmluvy o vyradení a údržbe zariadení, resp. nedostatočné, alebo chybné procedúry vyradenia a údržby môžu viesť k neoprávnenému prístupu k údajom a informáciám.
Data input from untrusted sources;Data obtained from untrusted sources, potential data compromise, etc.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Data input from untrusted sources;Data obtained from untrusted sources, potential data compromise, etc.;Vstup údajov z nedôveryhodných zdrojov;Údaje získané z nedôveryhodných zdrojov, možná kompromitácia údajov, atď.
Unauthorized intentional activity by users;Unauthorized and intentional activity by regular end-users (e.g., unauthorized reading, modification, copying, or deletion of database entries or data files, emails, etc.).;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized intentional activity by users;Unauthorized and intentional activity by regular end-users (e.g., unauthorized reading, modification, copying, or deletion of database entries or data files, emails, etc.).;Neautorizovaná úmyselná činnosť zo strany používateľov;Neautorizovaná a úmyselná činnosť zo strany bežných koncových používateľov (napr. neautorizované čítanie, modifikácia, kopírovanie alebo vymazanie položiek databázy alebo dátových súborov,  elektronickej pošty atď.).
Unauthorized intentional activity by privileged users;Unauthorized and intentional activity by operators, administrators, maintenance personnel, or other users with higher privileges than regular users (regardless of whether they are internal or external individuals, e.g., a contracted third party) (e.g., unauthorized reading, modification, copying, or deletion of database entries or data files, configuration files, local files, emails, logs, etc.).;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized intentional activity by privileged users;Unauthorized and intentional activity by operators, administrators, maintenance personnel, or other users with higher privileges than regular users (regardless of whether they are internal or external individuals, e.g., a contracted third party) (e.g., unauthorized reading, modification, copying, or deletion of database entries or data files, configuration files, local files, emails, logs, etc.).;Neautorizovaná úmyselná činnosť zo strany privilegovaných používateľov;Neautorizovaná a úmyselná činnosť zo strany operátorov, administrátorov, pracovníkov údržby alebo iných používateľov s vyššími oprávneniami ako bežný používateľ /nezávisle či ide o internú alebo externú osobu, napr. zmluvnú 3tiu stranu/ (napr. neautorizované čítanie, modifikácia, kopírovanie alebo vymazanie položiek databázy alebo dátových súborov, konfiguračných súborov, lokálnych súborov, elektronickej pošty, logov atď.).
Unauthorized intentional actions by operators or employees providing support services;Unauthorized and intentional actions by operators or employees providing support services (such as maintenance staff, cleaners, technicians), regardless of whether they are internal or external personnel, e.g., contract third parties.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Unauthorized intentional actions by operators or employees providing support services;Unauthorized and intentional actions by operators or employees providing support services (such as maintenance staff, cleaners, technicians), regardless of whether they are internal or external personnel, e.g., contract third parties.;Neautorizovaná úmyselná činnosť zo strany pracovníkov obsluhy alebo zamestnancov vykonávajúcich podporné služby;Neautorizovaná a úmyselná činnosť zo strany pracovníkov obsluhy alebo zamestnancov vykonávajúcich podporné služby (údržbár, upratovačka, technik) /nezávisle či ide o internú alebo externú osobu, napr. zmluvnú 3tiu stranu/.
User error;Unintentional and accidental user error, such as modifying data in databases, deleting files required for software operation, typos, incorrect data input, etc., e.g., due to high workload, stress, negative changes in working conditions, assigning tasks beyond the employee's capabilities, lack of knowledge and skills, etc.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;User error;Unintentional and accidental user error, such as modifying data in databases, deleting files required for software operation, typos, incorrect data input, etc., e.g., due to high workload, stress, negative changes in working conditions, assigning tasks beyond the employee's capabilities, lack of knowledge and skills, etc.;Chyba používateľa;Nechcená a neúmyselná chyba používateľa, napr. modifikácia údajov v databázach, zmazanie súborov, potrebných pre chod softvéru, preklep, zlé zadanie údajov a pod., napr. z dôvodu vysokého pracovného zaťaženia, stresu alebo negatívnej zmeny pracovných podmienok,  zadanie úlohy nad rámec schopností zamestnanca, slabé znalosti a zručnosti, atď.
Error of a privileged user;Unintentional and accidental error by an operator, administrator, or maintenance personnel, e.g., due to high workload, stress, or negative changes in working conditions, assigning tasks beyond the employee's capabilities, lack of knowledge and skills, etc.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;Error of a privileged user;Unintentional and accidental error by an operator, administrator, or maintenance personnel, e.g., due to high workload, stress, or negative changes in working conditions, assigning tasks beyond the employee's capabilities, lack of knowledge and skills, etc.;Chyba privilegovaného používateľa;Nechcená a neúmyselná chyba operátora, administrátora alebo údržby, napr. z dôvodu vysokého pracovného zaťaženia, stresu alebo negatívnej zmeny pracovných podmienok,  zadanie úlohy nad rámec schopností zamestnanca, slabé znalosti a zručnosti, atď.
Error or failure of operations, maintenance, or an employee performing support services;Unwanted and unintentional actions by operations, maintenance, or support service employees (such as maintenance staff, cleaners, technicians) that lead to accidental damage or errors, especially if these employees were not adequately trained on how to perform their tasks.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;Error or failure of operations, maintenance, or an employee performing support services;Unwanted and unintentional actions by operations, maintenance, or support service employees (such as maintenance staff, cleaners, technicians) that lead to accidental damage or errors, especially if these employees were not adequately trained on how to perform their tasks.;Chyba alebo zlyhanie obsluhy, údržby alebo zamestnanca vykonávajúceho podporné služby;Nechcená a neúmyselná činnosť obsluhy, údržby alebo zamestnancov vykonávajúcich podporné služby (údržbár, upratovačka, technik), ktorá vedie k neúmyselnému poškodeniu alebo chybe, najmä ak títo pracovníci neboli dostatočne zaškolení ako majú svoju činnosť vykonávať.
Repudiation (Denial of activity);Denial of activity (repudiation) or information origin (unauthorized denial of truthful information). It also refers to a state where an application or system fails to record user activity, allowing for malicious manipulation or falsification of activity identification. This poses a threat to the validity and integrity of actions within an application. It involves tampering or falsifying the identification of unauthorized activities, deleting logs, or writing incorrect data into log files, and so on.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Repudiation (Denial of activity);Denial of activity (repudiation) or information origin (unauthorized denial of truthful information). It also refers to a state where an application or system fails to record user activity, allowing for malicious manipulation or falsification of activity identification. This poses a threat to the validity and integrity of actions within an application. It involves tampering or falsifying the identification of unauthorized activities, deleting logs, or writing incorrect data into log files, and so on.;Popretie činnosti;Popretie činnosti alebo pôvodu informácie (neoprávnené popretie pravdivej informácie). Tiež stav, keď aplikácia alebo systém neprijme informáciu o zaznamenávaní aktivity používateľa, čo umožňuje zlomyseľnú manipuláciu alebo sfalšovanie identifikácie aktivít. Hrozba útoku na platnosť a integritu akcií v aplikácii. Manipulácia alebo sfalšovanie identifikácie nepovolených aktivít, vymazanie denníkov alebo zápis nesprávnych údajov do protokolových súborov a pod.
Improper use of equipment;Violation of policies or guidelines for the safe use of equipment.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;Improper use of equipment;Violation of policies or guidelines for the safe use of equipment.;Nesprávne používanie zariadení;Porušenie politík alebo návodov na bezpečné používanie zariadenia.
Disclosure of information;Unauthorized and intentional disclosure or revelation of information in violation of security measures implemented based on information classification, to individuals who should not have access to it.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Disclosure of information;Unauthorized and intentional disclosure or revelation of information in violation of security measures implemented based on information classification, to individuals who should not have access to it.;Prezradenie informácií;Neoprávnené a úmyselné zverejnenie alebo prezradenie informácií v rozpore s bezpečnostnými opatreniami prijatými na základe klasifikácie informácií, osobám, ktoré k nim nemajú mať prístup.
Incorrect disclosure of information;Unintentional and incorrect disclosure or provision of data to unauthorized individuals, not in compliance with security policies for classification levels, e.g., lack of knowledge of the classification scheme, classification level, or inadequate and improper labeling of the classification level, etc.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;Incorrect disclosure of information;Unintentional and incorrect disclosure or provision of data to unauthorized individuals, not in compliance with security policies for classification levels, e.g., lack of knowledge of the classification scheme, classification level, or inadequate and improper labeling of the classification level, etc.;Chybné zverejnenie informácií;Neúmyselné a chybné zverejnenie alebo poskytnutie údajov neoprávnenej osobe nie v súlade s bezpečnostnými pravidlami pre klasifikačné stupne, napr. neznalosť klasifikačnej schémy, klasifikačného stupňa alebo nedostatočné a nevhodné označenie klasifikačného stupňa a pod.
Use of unauthorized software;The use of illegal, counterfeit, or unlicensed software that may be modified to contain malware and compromise the computer system.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Use of unauthorized software;The use of illegal, counterfeit, or unlicensed software that may be modified to contain malware and compromise the computer system.;Používanie neautorizovaného softvéru;Použitie nelegálneho, falošného alebo nelicencovaného softvéru, ktorý môže byť upravený tak, aby obsahoval malvér a ohrozoval počítačový systém.
Use of unauthorized hardware;Use of hardware that has not been approved by the system owner or authorized personnel: Wi-Fi access points, sniffers, modems, switches, etc. Unauthorized manipulation of hardware, adding incompatible components that lead to malfunction, removal of necessary components required for the proper functioning of the system, tracking via hardware keyloggers, removal of device components, connecting devices (e.g., USB drives) to boot an operating system or obtain data, using USB keys or drives that are unsuitable for the classification of information, use or transfer of sensitive devices for personal use, storing private files, personal use, etc.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Use of unauthorized hardware;Use of hardware that has not been approved by the system owner or authorized personnel: Wi-Fi access points, sniffers, modems, switches, etc. Unauthorized manipulation of hardware, adding incompatible components that lead to malfunction, removal of necessary components required for the proper functioning of the system, tracking via hardware keyloggers, removal of device components, connecting devices (e.g., USB drives) to boot an operating system or obtain data, using USB keys or drives that are unsuitable for the classification of information, use or transfer of sensitive devices for personal use, storing private files, personal use, etc.;Použitie neautorizovaného hardvéru;Použitie hardvéru ktorý nebol schválený vlastníkom IS alebo oprávnenou osobou: wi-fi access point, sniffer, modem, switch a pod. Neoprávnená manipulácia s hardvérom, pridanie nekompatibilnej časti zariadenia, ktoré vedie k nefunkčnosti,  odobratie komponentov, potrebných pre správne fungovanie systému, sledovanie hardvérovým keyloggerom,  odstránenie komponentov zariadenia,  pripojenie zariadení (napr. USB diskov) pre štart OS alebo získanie dát, použitie USB kľúčov alebo diskov, ktoré nie sú vhodné pre danú klasifikáciu informácií, použitie alebo prenos citlivých zariadení pre osobné použitie, ukladanie súkromných súborov, osobné použitie atď. 
Illegal and unauthorized processing of data;Unauthorized and illegal manipulation of information outside the legal framework without consent or other legal authorization. The use of data for private or other unauthorized purposes. Unauthorized disclosure, provision, or release of personal data collected, for example, in connection with the exercise of public authority or the exercise of constitutional rights, or obtained in connection with the performance of one's profession, employment, or official duties.;FALSE;TRUE;FALSE;Illegal and unauthorized processing of data;Unauthorized and illegal manipulation of information outside the legal framework without consent or other legal authorization. The use of data for private or other unauthorized purposes. Unauthorized disclosure, provision, or release of personal data collected, for example, in connection with the exercise of public authority or the exercise of constitutional rights, or obtained in connection with the performance of one's profession, employment, or official duties.;Nezákonné a neoprávnené spracovanie údajov;Neoprávnená a nezákonná manipulácia s informáciami mimo rámec zákona bez súhlasu alebo inej zákonnej autorizácie. Použitie údajov na súkromné alebo iné neautorizované účely. Neoprávnené poskytnutie, sprístupnenie alebo zverejnenie osobných údajov zhromaždené napr. v súvislosti s výkonom verejnej moci alebo uplatňovaním ústavných práv osoby, alebo získaných v súvislosti s výkonom svojho povolania, zamestnania alebo funkcie.
Human communication failure;For example, inappropriate communication by individuals (employees and external parties) in public or in front of unauthorized persons, or misunderstanding information, or poor interpretation of data, based on which activities are incorrectly defined and subsequently carried out.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;Human communication failure;For example, inappropriate communication by individuals (employees and external parties) in public or in front of unauthorized persons, or misunderstanding information, or poor interpretation of data, based on which activities are incorrectly defined and subsequently carried out.;Ľudské zlyhanie pri komunikácii;Napr. nevhodná komunikácia osôb (zamestnancov aj externých subjektov) na verejnosti alebo pred neautorizovanými osobami alebo nepochopenie informácie, prípadne zlá interpretácia údajov, na základe ktorých sú chybne definované a následne vykonávané činnosti.
Denial of service;Disruption of processes, infrastructure, or other elements in order to disable a service (typically DoS, DDoS).;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Denial of service;Disruption of processes, infrastructure, or other elements in order to disable a service (typically DoS, DDoS).;Odmietnutie služby;Narušenie procesov, infraštruktúry alebo iných prvkov za účelom znefunkčnenia služby (typicky DoS, DDoS).
Software or service failure;Software errors caused by issues like bad code (e.g., unhandled states), errors during updates, configurations, or maintenance, failure to renew licenses for software used to access data, etc.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Software or service failure;Software errors caused by issues like bad code (e.g., unhandled states), errors during updates, configurations, or maintenance, failure to renew licenses for software used to access data, etc.;Porucha softvéru alebo služby;Chyby SW spôsobené napr. zlým kódom (napr. neošetrené všetky stavy a pod.), chyby počas aktualizácie, konfigurácie alebo údržby, neobnovenie licencie na softvér používaný na prístup k údajom, atď.
Device or system failure;Sudden and unplanned failure or malfunction of IT equipment or any hardware component that can cause a decrease in data availability. Increased likelihood of device or system failure due to factors such as excessive load, physical stress, environmental conditions in which the device operates, etc.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Device or system failure;Sudden and unplanned failure or malfunction of IT equipment or any hardware component that can cause a decrease in data availability. Increased likelihood of device or system failure due to factors such as excessive load, physical stress, environmental conditions in which the device operates, etc.;Porucha zariadenia alebo systému;Náhle a neplánované zlyhanie alebo porucha IT zariadenia, alebo akéhokoľvek HW komponentu, ktoré môže spôsobiť zníženie úrovne dostupnosti údajov. Zvýšená pravdepodobnosť poruchy zariadenia alebo systému ako takého, napr. z dôvodu nadmernej záťaže, fyzickej záťaže, klimatických podmienok, v ktorých musí zariadenie pracovať a pod.
Overloading of the information system;Full storage unit, system overload, failure caused by insufficient capacity of the information system, etc.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Overloading of the information system;Full storage unit, system overload, failure caused by insufficient capacity of the information system, etc.;Zahltenie informačného systému;Plná úložná jednotka, preťaženie systému,  zlyhanie spôsobené nedostatočnou kapacitou IS, atď.
Telecommunication network failure;Damage to telecommunication connections, destruction of cabling, failure of optical connection components, unavailable WiFi connection, etc.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Telecommunication network failure;Damage to telecommunication connections, destruction of cabling, failure of optical connection components, unavailable WiFi connection, etc.;Porucha telekomunikačnej siete;Poškodenie telekomunikačného spojenia, zničenie kabeláže, výpadok komponentov optického spojenia, nedostupné WiFi pripojenie, atď. 
Power system failure, power loss, or fluctuations in performance;Any failure of the power system, loss of power source, or fluctuations in device power supply, or limited or interrupted energy supply, or disruption or damage to energy infrastructure.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Power system failure, power loss, or fluctuations in performance;Any failure of the power system, loss of power source, or fluctuations in device power supply, or limited or interrupted energy supply, or disruption or damage to energy infrastructure.;Porucha napájacieho systému, strata napájania alebo kolísanie výkonu;Akákoľvek porucha napájacieho systému, strata zdroja napájania alebo kolísanie výkonu napájania zariadení alebo obmedzená, prípadne zastavená dodávka energií alebo narušenie, resp. poškodenie energetickej infraštruktúry.
Failure of the cooling or ventilation system;Failure of the air conditioning or water supply system, which can cause system outages and subsequently reduce data availability.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Failure of the cooling or ventilation system;Failure of the air conditioning or water supply system, which can cause system outages and subsequently reduce data availability.;Porucha chladiaceho alebo ventilačného systému;Porucha klimatizácie alebo prívodu vody, ktorá môže spôsobiť výpadky systémov a následne zníženie úrovne dostupnosti údajov.
Office equipment failure;Limitation of functionality or complete malfunction of auxiliary office equipment (copiers, phones, faxes).;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Office equipment failure;Limitation of functionality or complete malfunction of auxiliary office equipment (copiers, phones, faxes).;Porucha kancelárskeho vybavenia;Obmedzenie funkčnosti alebo úplné znefunkčnenie pomocného kancelárskeho vybavenia (kopírky, telefóny, faxy).
Degradation of equipment or storage media (obsolescence);The aging of devices or stored and archived data, gradual degradation, and loss of data or system/device malfunction.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Degradation of equipment or storage media (obsolescence);The aging of devices or stored and archived data, gradual degradation, and loss of data or system/device malfunction.;Zhoršovanie stavu zariadení alebo pamäťových médií (zastaralosť);Starnutie zariadení alebo uložených a archivovaných údajov, postupná degradácia a strata údajov alebo nefunkčnosť systému alebo zariadenia.
Disruption of availability during an audit or other authorized security assessment;Disruption of service or system availability or operation during an audit or other authorized information security review.;TRUE;FALSE;FALSE;Disruption of availability during an audit or other authorized security assessment;Disruption of service or system availability or operation during an audit or other authorized information security review.;Narušenie dostupnosti počas auditného alebo iného autorizovaného preverovania bezpečnosti;Narušenie dostupnosti alebo prevádzky služby alebo systému počas auditného alebo iného autorizovaného preverovania informačnej bezpečnosti.
Poor planning and adaptation shortcomings;Neglecting security requirements during the planning, purchasing, and implementation of devices, services, and processes.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Poor planning and adaptation shortcomings;Neglecting security requirements during the planning, purchasing, and implementation of devices, services, and processes.;Chybné plánovanie a nedostatky v adaptácii;Zanedbanie bezpečnostných požiadaviek pri plánovaní, nákupe a implementácii zariadení, služieb a procesov.
Lack of staff;Termination, contract cancellation, company acquisition or part of it, employee takeover, reorganization, job termination due to organizational changes, workplace injuries, occupational diseases, other injuries or illnesses, death, neurological, psychological, or psychiatric diagnoses, etc.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Lack of staff;Termination, contract cancellation, company acquisition or part of it, employee takeover, reorganization, job termination due to organizational changes, workplace injuries, occupational diseases, other injuries or illnesses, death, neurological, psychological, or psychiatric diagnoses, etc.;Nedostatok personálu;Preloženie, ukončenie kontraktu alebo zrušenie, prevzatie firmy alebo jej časti, prevzatie zamestnanca, zmena zaradenia, ukončenie procesu po organizačnej zmene, pracovný úraz, choroba z povolania, iné zranenie alebo choroba, smrť, neurologická, psychologická alebo psychiatrická diagnóza, atď.
Lack of resources;Insufficient or improper management of financial, technical, and other resources (excluding personnel resources).;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Lack of resources;Insufficient or improper management of financial, technical, and other resources (excluding personnel resources).;Nedostatok zdrojov;Nedostatok alebo nesprávne riadenie finančných, technických a iných zdrojov (mimo personálnych zdrojov).
Employee strike or refusal to act;Employee protests or strikes, or refusal to act and denial of work responsibilities, particularly negatively impacting system or service availability.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Employee strike or refusal to act;Employee protests or strikes, or refusal to act and denial of work responsibilities, particularly negatively impacting system or service availability.;Štrajk zamestnancov alebo odmietnutie konania;Protest alebo štrajk zamestnancov, prípadne odmietnutie konania a odoprenie pracovnej zodpovednosti s negatívnym vplyvom najmä na dostupnosť systémov alebo služieb.
Social Engineering;Influencing users or employees in general through phishing, social engineering, bribery, etc., or applying pressure (threatening emails, psychological harassment, etc.) to obtain data or system access, etc.;FALSE;TRUE;TRUE;Social Engineering;Influencing users or employees in general through phishing, social engineering, bribery, etc., or applying pressure (threatening emails, psychological harassment, etc.) to obtain data or system access, etc.;Sociálne inžinierstvo;Ovplyvňovanie používateľov , resp. zamestnancov vo všeobecnosti, formou phishingu, sociálneho inžinierstva, podplácania, a pod., alebo vyvíjanie nátlaku (výhražné emaily, psychologické obťažovanie atď.) s cieľom získať údaje alebo prístup do systému a pod.
Reputation damage;Damage to reputation through any intentional or unintentional actions (gossip, slander, misinformation, discrediting of organization representatives, damaging goodwill, data breach, data loss, significant security incident, etc.).;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Reputation damage;Damage to reputation through any intentional or unintentional actions (gossip, slander, misinformation, discrediting of organization representatives, damaging goodwill, data breach, data loss, significant security incident, etc.).;Poškodenie reputácie;Poškodenie reputácie akýmkoľvek úmyselným alebo neúmyselným konaním (klebety, ohováranie, dezinformácie, dehonestácia predstaviteľov organizácie, poškodzovanie dobrého mena, únik dát, strata dát, významný bezpečnostný incident atď.).
Service provider failure;Disruption of outsourced services, such as gas, electricity, telecommunications, water, ventilation, etc.;TRUE;TRUE;TRUE;Service provider failure;Disruption of outsourced services, such as gas, electricity, telecommunications, water, ventilation, etc.;Zlyhanie poskytovateľa služieb;"Prerušenie ""outsourcovaných"" služieb, napr. dodávky plynu, elektrickej energie, telekomunikačných služieb, vody, ventilácie atď."
Software design or development errors;Creating a product that lacks sufficient security features or fails to implement security elements due to poor design definition, or one that contains bugs introduced during development, such as using vulnerable libraries, lacking adequate internal testing, etc.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Software design or development errors;Creating a product that lacks sufficient security features or fails to implement security elements due to poor design definition, or one that contains bugs introduced during development, such as using vulnerable libraries, lacking adequate internal testing, etc.;Chyby softvéru pri návrhu alebo vývoji;Vytvorenie produktu, ktorý nemá dostatočné bezpečnostné funkcie alebo nemá zavedené bezpečnostné prvky vplyvom nedostatočného definovania pri návrhu, alebo ktorý obsahuje chyby zanesené pri vývoji, používa napr. zraniteľné knižnice, neprešiel dostatočným interným testovaním a pod.
Using software that does not meet security requirements;For example, using COTS (Commercial-off-the-shelf) software that does not meet the required security standards or criteria.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Using software that does not meet security requirements;For example, using COTS (Commercial-off-the-shelf) software that does not meet the required security standards or criteria.;Použitie SW, ktorý nespĺňa bezpečnostné požiadavky;Použitie napr. COTS (Commercial-off-the-shelf or commercially available off-the-shelf) softvéru, ktorý nespĺňa bezpečnostné požiadavky alebo štandardy.
Violation of internal policies or standards;Non-compliance with established internal regulations, standards, and norms, leading to potential incidents.;TRUE;TRUE;FALSE;Violation of internal policies or standards;Non-compliance with established internal regulations, standards, and norms, leading to potential incidents.;Porušenie interných riadiacich aktov alebo noriem;Nesúlad s platnými internými predpismi, štandardmi a normami a ich porušenia vyúsťujúce do potenciálneho incidentu.
Violation of laws or regulations;Non-compliance with applicable regulations, breach of law resulting in criminal, administrative, or other legal consequences.;TRUE;TRUE;FALSE;Violation of laws or regulations;Non-compliance with applicable regulations, breach of law resulting in criminal, administrative, or other legal consequences.;Porušenie zákonov alebo nariadení;Nesúlad s platnou reguláciou, porušenie zákona vyúsťujúce do trestnoprávnej, správno-právnej alebo inej právnej konzekvencie.
Copyright violation;Unauthorized use of software without a valid license, multiple installations beyond permitted usage, or using software not listed as authorized by the organization.;TRUE;TRUE;FALSE;Copyright violation;Unauthorized use of software without a valid license, multiple installations beyond permitted usage, or using software not listed as authorized by the organization.;Porušenie autorských práv;Použitie softvéru, na ktorý nemá organizácia licenciu alebo viacnásobná inštalácia, alebo ktorý nie je v zozname autorizovaného softvéru organizácie a pod.
Detectability – violation of anonymity or pseudonymity;The potential for an attacker to sufficiently discern from stored data whether the subject of interest or an item within a dataset exists (e.g., the ability to distinguish files containing personal data from other types of data, the reverse engineering of an algorithm ensuring the anonymity or pseudonymity of individuals, thereby uncovering actual identities, etc.).;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Detectability – violation of anonymity or pseudonymity;The potential for an attacker to sufficiently discern from stored data whether the subject of interest or an item within a dataset exists (e.g., the ability to distinguish files containing personal data from other types of data, the reverse engineering of an algorithm ensuring the anonymity or pseudonymity of individuals, thereby uncovering actual identities, etc.).;Detekovateľnosť - narušenie anonymity alebo pseudoanonymity;Potenciál, že útočník dokáže z uložených údajov dostatočne rozlíšiť, či predmet záujmu, resp. položka množiny jestvuje alebo nie (napr. schopnosť rozpoznania súborov obsahujúcich osobné údaje od iných typov údajov, spätná reverzibilita algoritmu zabezpečujúcemu anonymitu alebo pseudoanonymitu osôb a teda získanie skutočných identít a pod.).
Identifiability;The potential for an attacker to directly identify affected individuals associated with record subjects (e.g., recognizing personal data of a specific data subject in a dataset). Identifiability is a specific type of linkability, where the attributes of the affected individuals are also included.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Identifiability;The potential for an attacker to directly identify affected individuals associated with record subjects (e.g., recognizing personal data of a specific data subject in a dataset). Identifiability is a specific type of linkability, where the attributes of the affected individuals are also included.;Identifikovateľnosť;Potenciál, že útočník dokáže priamo identifikovať dotknuté osoby asociované na predmety evidencie (napr. v súbore údajov rozpoznať osobné údaje konkrétnej dotknutej osoby). Identifikovateľnosť je špeciálny typ spojiteľnosti, kde sú zahrnuté aj atribúty dotknutých osôb.
Linkability;Linkability is the threat that an attacker can indirectly recognize the nature of an entity or the relationships between entities (e.g., the sender by domain, activity, subject of the message, or by the content itself, insufficient measures, poorly implemented measures, etc.).;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Linkability;Linkability is the threat that an attacker can indirectly recognize the nature of an entity or the relationships between entities (e.g., the sender by domain, activity, subject of the message, or by the content itself, insufficient measures, poorly implemented measures, etc.).;Spojiteľnosť, linkovateľnosť;Spojiteľnosť (linkovateľnosť)  je hrozba, že útočník dokáže aj nepriamo rozpoznať podstatu entity, alebo vzájomné vzťahy entít (napr. odosielateľa podľa domény, aktivity, alebo podľa predmetu správy, prípadne podľa samotného obsahu, nedostatočných opatrení, zle implementovaných opatrení a pod.).
Non-compliance with the legal basis - violation of the rights of the data subject;Non-compliance of processing with policies and legal basis (e.g., consent given). Despite the declaration of compliance with policies, there is no guarantee that the system actually adheres to the established rules. This can subsequently lead to a violation of the data subject's rights.;FALSE;FALSE;TRUE;Non-compliance with the legal basis - violation of the rights of the data subject;Non-compliance of processing with policies and legal basis (e.g., consent given). Despite the declaration of compliance with policies, there is no guarantee that the system actually adheres to the established rules. This can subsequently lead to a violation of the data subject's rights.;Nesúlad s právnym základom - porušenie práv dotknutej osoby;Nesúlad spracovania s politikami a právnym základom (napr. poskytnutým súhlasom). Napriek deklarácii súladu spracovania s politikami, neexistuje záruka, že systém skutočne vyhovuje prijatým pravidlám. Tým následne môže nastať porušenie práv dotknutej osoby. 
